# Auto-activates the darktable dev shell when you cd into the checkout, and
# lets Doom's :tools direnv module hand the same environment to eglot/clangd.
#
# Uses the flake devShell (devShells.x86_64-linux.darktable) so the toolchain
# is pinned by your nix-configs flake.lock. nix-direnv caches it after the
# first entry. `nix-shell` on the sibling shell.nix still works as a fallback.
use flake ~/nix-configs#darktable
